      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related by:\nProvide some indication when a request invite is sent to a player in a friends-only instance\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/provide-some-indication-when-a-request-invite-is-sent-to-a-player-in-a-friends-o\nimprove the req Invite problem\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/improve-the-req-invite-problem",
